cff-version: 1.2.0
title: simulation_coarse — Client-Side Multi-Scale Biomolecular Dynamics and Free Energy Landscapes
abstract: >-
  Browser-native coarse-grained Cα ENM and all-atom heavy-atom MD with HCT
  GB/SA, BAOAB Langevin, well-tempered funnel metadynamics, and a 4-state
  Markovian Chemical Network (TPT). Zero-install, WebGPU/Web-Worker accelerated.
version: v1.0-jpcb
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: MIT
type: software
